sequenceDiagram
    title Sign in
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant I as Identity
    participant D@{ "type": "database" }
    autonumber
    U->>W: open sign-in
    W->>+I: redirect to authorize
    Note over U,I: The user signs in with a passkey
    I-->>-W: code
    alt code valid
        W->>I: exchange code
        I-->>W: tokens
    else code expired
        W-->>U: show error
    else
        W-)D: log failure
    end
    loop every 5 minutes
        W->>I: refresh token
    end
    par audit
        W-)D: write audit
    and metrics
        W-)D: write metric
    end
    opt remember me
        W->>D: store session
    end
    W-->>U: signed in
